{"texte":"Why is a tiny country like Panama so important? Before 1914, a ship from New York to San Francisco had to sail all the way around South America. That's more than twenty thousand kilometers, through the storms of Cape Horn. Then the Panama Canal opened. Just eighty kilometers, saving about thirteen thousand kilometers of sailing. Today, more than ten thousand ships cross it every year, between the Atlantic and the Pacific. Whoever controls this narrow strip controls a crossroads of world trade. And since 1999, that's Panama.","caracteres":["W","h","y"," ","i","s"," ","a"," ","t","i","n","y"," ","c","o","u","n","t","r","y"," ","l","i","k","e"," ","P","a","n","a","m","a"," ","s","o"," ","i","m","p","o","r","t","a","n","t","?"," ","B","e","f","o","r","e"," ","1","9","1","4",","," ","a"," ","s","h","i","p"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","N","e","w"," ","Y","o","r","k"," ","t","o"," ","S","a","n"," ","F","r","a","n","c","i","s","c","o"," ","h","a","d"," ","t","o"," ","s","a","i","l"," ","a","l","l"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","a","r","o","u","n","d"," ","S","o","u","t","h"," ","A","m","e","r","i","c","a","."," ","T","h","a","t","'","s"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","t","w","e","n","t","y"," ","t","h","o","u","s","a","n","d"," ","k","i","l","o","m","e","t","e","r","s",","," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","t","o","r","m","s"," ","o","f"," ","C","a","p","e"," ","H","o","r","n","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","P","a","n","a","m","a"," ","C","a","n","a","l"," ","o","p","e","n","e","d","."," ","J","u","s","t"," ","e","i","g","h","t","y"," ","k","i","l","o","m","e","t","e","r","s",","," ","s","a","v","i","n","g"," ","a","b","o","u","t"," ","t","h","i","r","t","e","e","n"," ","t","h","o","u","s","a","n","d"," ","k","i","l","o","m","e","t","e","r","s"," ","o","f"," ","s","a","i","l","i","n","g","."," ","T","o","d","a","y",","," ","m","o","r","e"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","t","e","n"," ","t","h","o","u","s","a","n","d"," ","